 has 37 ready requirements (R2.3-R4.9). All other incomplete releases (04.1, 05.0, etc.) also have ready requirements but are lower priority.\n\n## Weight Check\n\nAssuming default weight 1 for all srd008-ls R2.x requirements:\n- Task 0: R2.3(1) + R2.4(1) + R2.5(1) + R2.6(1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 1: same R-items, test coverage = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 2: R2.7(1) + R2.8(1) + R2.9(1) + R2.10(1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 3: same R-items, test coverage = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n\nFour tasks will cover the R2.3-R2.10 requirements, splitting implementation and testing work across the weight limit.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57362,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57362},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dfcd38d5-f0ec-44f7-acab-8a8be7b613cf","uuid":"b41333bd-adae-4674-b937-6127f5b84918"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RAP7v8YkZozpxZgk1uWH4M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: go-unix-utils reimplements GNU coreutils/moreutils in Go, verified by differential testing against Homebrew reference binaries. The goal is stress-testing the mage-claude-orchestrator code generation system.\n\n**Architecture**: `cmd/` (one package per utility), `pkg/testutils` (differential testing harness), `pkg/sys` (syscall abstractions), `pkg/format` (output formatting), `magefiles/` (build automation), `docs/specs/` (SRDs, use cases, test suites).\n\n**Current state**: Multiple utilities implemented across releases 00.0–03.1. The `ls` utility (rel04.0, srd008-ls) is actively in progress — requirements R1.1–R2.2 are complete per recent commits. Requirements R2.3–R4.9 (37 items) remain with status \"ready\". Releases 04.1 through 15.0 have all requirements ready but are lower priority.\n\n**Current release**: 04.0 (ls). The earliest incomplete release with ready requirements.\n\n## Priority Reasoning\n\nRelease 04.0 is the focus. srd008-ls R2.3–R4.9 are all \"ready\". Per P1 (release-driven priority), I propose tasks for these R-items. Per P2 (split impl/tests), each batch of 4 R-items becomes an implementation task + a test task. With the 4-task limit, I cover R2.3–R2.10 (8 R-items across 4 tasks).\n\n## Weight Budget Check\n\nAssuming default weight 1 for srd008-ls R2.x requirements (no weight-4 restructuring noted for R2 group):\n\n- Task 0: R2.3(w=1) + R2.4(w=1) + R2.5(w=1) + R2.6(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 1: R2.3(w=1) + R2.4(w=1) + R2.5(w=1) + R2.6(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓ (test task)\n- Task 2: R2.7(w=1) + R2.8(w=1) + R2.9(w=1) + R2.10(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓\n- Task 3: R2.7(w=1) + R2.8(w=1) + R2.9(w=1) + R2.10(w=1) = 4 ≤ 4 ✓ (test task)\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/ls: extended features implementation (srd008-ls R2.3-R2.6)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml (requirements R2.3, R2.4, R2.5, R2.6)\n      - cmd/ls/main.go (existing implementation to extend)\n      - pkg/sys/ (file metadata via Stat/Lstat, terminal width via TerminalWidth)\n      - pkg/format/ (output formatting, column alignment, color support)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (component dependencies for srd008-ls)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/ls/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add implementation for srd008-ls R2.3-R2.6\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd008-ls R2.3 per the SRD specification in cmd/ls/main.go\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd008-ls R2.4 per the SRD specification in cmd/ls/main.go\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd008-ls R2.5 per the SRD specification in cmd/ls/main.go\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd008-ls R2.6 per the SRD specification in cmd/ls/main.go\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Extend the existing cmd/ls/main.go -- read all existing source files in cmd/ls/ to understand the current structure before modifying\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use pkg/sys for file metadata (Stat, Lstat) and pkg/format for output formatting (HumanSize, FileTypeColor, Columns, PadRight, PadLeft)\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per SIGPIPE shared protocol\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Do not add differential test cases in this task -- tests are in a separate task\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"srd008-ls R2.3 functionality implemented and compiles\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"srd008-ls R2.4 functionality implemented and compiles\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"srd008-ls R2.5 functionality implemented and compiles\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"srd008-ls R2.6 functionality implemented and compiles\"\n      - id: A